---
title: HR Portal Pro · Super Admin workflow
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor SA as Super Admin
  participant APP as HR Portal (app)
  participant DB as MySQL (RDS)
  participant SES as Email (SES)
  actor NU as New HR Admin / Manager

  rect rgb(239, 232, 251)
  Note over SA,NU: Phase 1 · Sign in
  SA->>APP: Open ALB URL, sign in with bootstrap login
  APP->>DB: Check password (BCrypt), failed-attempt count
  alt 5 wrong passwords
    APP-->>SA: Account locked
    APP->>SES: Email HR: "account locked"
  else correct
    APP-->>SA: Dashboard (company counts, HR approvals waiting)
  end
  SA->>APP: Change own password (8+ chars, letters + numbers)
  APP->>DB: Save new hash + audit entry
  end

  rect rgb(226, 244, 240)
  Note over SA,NU: Phase 2 · Set up the company
  SA->>APP: Add departments (Engineering, HR, Finance)
  APP->>DB: Save · names must be unique
  SA->>APP: Add public holidays
  APP->>DB: Save · same date twice is refused
  opt Delete a department
    APP-->>SA: Refused if it has or had employees
  end
  end

  rect rgb(227, 237, 251)
  Note over SA,NU: Phase 3 · Onboard the leaders
  SA->>APP: New employee: name, email, department, salary, joining date, role HR Admin
  Note right of APP: Only a Super Admin may grant HR Admin or Super Admin
  APP->>DB: Create employee + login, leave balances, audit entry
  APP-->>SA: Temporary password, shown once
  APP->>SES: Welcome email to the new hire (after commit)
  SES-->>NU: "Welcome to HR Portal Pro"
  SA-->>NU: Share the temporary password securely
  NU->>APP: First sign-in
  APP-->>NU: Must change password, then complete profile
  end

  rect rgb(251, 239, 220)
  Note over SA,NU: Phase 4 · Manage logins (Users page)
  SA->>APP: Change a user's role
  APP->>DB: Save · audit "role: old → new" (own role is refused)
  SA->>APP: Unlock a locked account
  APP->>DB: Reset failed attempts · audit
  SA->>APP: Reset a password
  APP-->>SA: New temporary password (user must change it)
  SA->>APP: Disable / enable a login
  APP->>DB: Save · own account or someone who left is refused
  end

  rect rgb(244, 246, 248)
  Note over SA,NU: Phase 5 · Oversight
  SA->>APP: Open the audit log, filter by record type
  APP->>DB: Read audit entries
  APP-->>SA: Who did what, when, old → new
  SA->>APP: Everything HR does: leave, attendance, payroll, documents, reports
  SA->>APP: REST API via /swagger-ui.html (HTTP Basic)
  end
